        phase's ℍ-level Born weight;
    (5) POSITIVITY + SUPPRESSION: `0 < mbRatioDerived < 1` (`mbRatioDerived_pos`, `mbRatioDerived_lt_one`)
        — the down leg genuinely below the top;
    (6) TEETH: the fold-phase factor genuinely bites (`mbRatioDerived_ne_survival`); the relative-scale
        residual is real (`crossSector_scale_genuine`).

    Statable from no single conjunct alone (non-hollow). ⚠ HONEST GRADE: (1)–(6) THEOREM-EXACT now
    (exact facts/(in)equalities of `Cut`/ℚ, no error bar, foundations-only). CANDIDATE (owner-authorized
